  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bonhawaye | Cowpea Production Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture; Crop: cowpeas.Beneficiaries: 57,624 total; 36,303 females .Supporting expansion of Federation Mooriben&apos;s production of cowpeas. Grant funds will be used to construct a warehouse for crop storage; to procure a scale to weigh products for purchase or sale; to provide working capital to establish a crop purchase fund; to obtain training and technical assistance for members in cooperative management, marketing, and postharvest storage; and to cover project administrative costs.</narrative>
  </description>
